UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["The entity''s overall marketing effectiveness and strategy","Proper classification of debt as current or noncurrent and related disclosures","The entity''s projected cash flows for the next five years","The adequacy of the entity''s property and casualty insurance"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AR-C 90.32, inquiries about debt covenant compliance help assess whether debt is properly classified in the financial statements. Covenant violations may require reclassification from long-term to current under ASC 470-10-45 and may also indicate going concern issues requiring disclosure.
Wrong (A): Marketing effectiveness is an operational matter unrelated to debt covenant compliance inquiries during a review engagement.
Wrong (C): Five-year cash flow projections go beyond the scope of a review inquiry about covenant compliance, which focuses on current classification and disclosure.
Wrong (D): Insurance coverage adequacy is unrelated to debt covenant compliance. The inquiry targets debt classification and related financial statement presentation.$EXPL$
